 "remarks": "Turn-key 1 bedroom, 1 full bathroom condo ideally located in the heart of downtown Stamford. This bright and inviting unit features high ceilings, creating an open and airy feel, along with central heating and air conditioning for year-round comfort. The unit can be sold furnished as well. Enjoy the convenience of amenities located on the same floor, including a fitness center, common laundry room, community room, courtyard, and a pet relief area. Covered garage parking is available with a monthly parking pass. Perfectly situated with easy access to I-95 and minutes from Stamford Train Station. This home is within walking distance of the Stamford Town Center, restaurants, entertainment, and local parks. Don't miss this opportunity to own a move-in-ready condo in a prime downtown location. Schedule your private showing today!",
